  "description": "Once upon a time, a neglected princess died a tragic death, only to wake up as a child once more and find herself beloved by all. This is the novel Leivella wakes up in, but she’s not the princess. Instead, she’s a mere extra whose family was framed and slaughtered by the tyrannical emperor. Now serving as the princess’s food taster who tests for poison, Leivella must find a way to avoid meeting a tragic death of her own. The world may revolve around its protagonist, but the unmentioned extra might have a shot at writing her own fate!\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
